    <briefdescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>categories</computeroutput> list of a series: the <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category" kindref="compound">Category</ref></computeroutput> objects and a lookup table that follows their edits. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The table updates on every change, quietly. Duplicate values and names are reported once the event loop runs, after QML bindings of newly declared categories have been evaluated. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
